version 0.10
view buck-5v

# TPS5430 5V/3A buck print page. Every net is drawn. GND is a bus below the parts (the view layer has
# no ground-symbol primitive); the divider's ground end sits above the parts, so it climbs to the bus
# through the gap left of C3. Different-net crossings are legal and carry no dot
# (spec/schematic-view.md §5.1): every dot on this page is a junction that exists.
#
# The buck is module M2 of the board, so the page names the board's flat ids: M2.U1, M2.C2, ...
# (spec/module.md §7). Every symbol origin and every bend below is a multiple of 0.5 mm (ADR-0057),
# so a pin point can always be reached by an axis-aligned run.
#
# The feedback net is named twice instead of run across the page: one label sits on the chip's VSENSE
# pin, the other on the divider's own node. A label may sit on a pin (spec/schematic-view.md §6), so
# the chip's body is narrow enough to leave room for the label beside that pin.
#
# The two board ports end runs (ADR-0062): the GND port is the west end of the bus, and the VOUT_5V
# port hangs off C4.1. Moving either port carries the run that ends at it.
place
  M2.C1  117.5  96.5  90
  M2.C2  161.5  102.0  270
  M2.C3  212.0  105.0  90
  M2.C4  228.5  105.0  90
  M2.D1  177.5  108.5  90
  M2.L1  189.0  91.5  0
  M2.R1  197.0  105.0  90
  M2.R2  197.0  115.5  90
  M2.U1  140.0  105.0  0

wire
  GND      GND      M2.C1.2  117.5 121.0
  GND      M2.C1.2  M2.U1.6  117.5 121.0  139.5 121.0
  GND      M2.C3.2  M2.C4.2  212.0 121.0  228.5 121.0
  GND      M2.D1.2  M2.R2.2  177.5 121.0  197.0 121.0
  GND      M2.R2.2  M2.C3.2  197.0 121.0  212.0 121.0
  GND      M2.U1.6  M2.U1.9  139.5 121.0  142.0 121.0
  GND      M2.U1.9  M2.D1.2  142.0 121.0  177.5 121.0
  M2.BOOT  M2.U1.1  M2.C2.1  161.5 108.5
  M2.PH    M2.C2.2  M2.D1.1  177.5 98.0
  M2.PH    M2.D1.1  M2.L1.1  177.5 98.0  180.0 98.0  180.0 91.5
  M2.PH    M2.U1.8  M2.C2.2  155.0 98.0
  M2.VFB   M2.R1.2  M2.R2.1  198.5 109.0  198.5 111.5
  SYS      M2.C1.1  M2.U1.7  117.5 86.0  140.0 86.0
  VOUT     M2.C3.1  M2.C4.1
  VOUT     M2.C3.1  M2.R1.1
  VOUT     M2.C4.1  VOUT_5V
  VOUT     M2.L1.2  M2.C3.1  212.0 91.5

